== 1. pairing order is taken as written ==
a 1-4 against b (forward/forward): ACCEPT :: created=12 consumed=12 final={}
   pairs: [(1, 1), (2, 2), (3, 3), (4, 4)]
a 1-4 against b (forward/reverse): ACCEPT :: created=12 consumed=12 final={}
   pairs: [(1, 4), (2, 3), (3, 2), (4, 1)]
== 2. a strip seamed to itself: both pairings of its own first and last rows ==
aligned: r4 4..1 with lip 1..4: ACCEPT :: created=32 consumed=28 final={'outside': 4}
   pairs (r4 index, r1 index): [(4, 1), (3, 2), (2, 3), (1, 4)]
   text: 8. **s**（`s`）：将 r4 的顺序工作位第 1–4 位（反向）（只挑后半针 BLO）与 lip 的顺序工作位第 1–4 位（正向）（已预留的前半针 FLO）依序配对，同时穿过两侧作引拔接合；接合针不作为下一行工作边。
crossed: r4 4..1 with lip 4..1: ACCEPT :: created=32 consumed=28 final={'outside': 4}
   pairs (r4 index, r1 index): [(4, 4), (3, 3), (2, 2), (1, 1)]
   text: 8. **s**（`s`）：将 r4 的顺序工作位第 1–4 位（反向）（只挑后半针 BLO）与 lip 的顺序工作位第 1–4 位（反向）（已预留的前半针 FLO）依序配对，同时穿过两侧作引拔接合；接合针不作为下一行工作边。
== 3. self reference / aliases ==
same span on both sides: REJECT  [as expected] :: 接缝不能通过别名将同一针位接到自身
same sites through a hold alias: REJECT  [as expected] :: 接缝不能通过别名将同一针位接到自身
left through alias, right through original name: REJECT  [as expected] :: 针位已保留给 h，须通过该保留边继续
an edge folded onto itself (a 1-2 against a 4-3): ACCEPT  [as expected] :: created=10 consumed=6 final={'b': 4}
overlapping halves (a 1-3 against a 3-1): REJECT  [as expected] :: 接缝不能通过别名将同一针位接到自身
a stitch's BLO seamed to the same stitch's reserved FLO (lip made by an earlier BLO row): ACCEPT :: created=18 consumed=12 final={'r2': 2, 'rest': 4}
== 4. unequal lengths, consumed / held sites ==
3 against 4: REJECT  [as expected] :: 接缝两侧针位数不一致，不能静默拉伸或补针
seam over stitches already worked: REJECT  [as expected] :: 针位已使用，不能通过其他别名再次使用：Site(edge='a', position=1, face='top')
seam over a binding edge of an earlier seam: REJECT  [as expected] :: 针位已使用，不能通过其他别名再次使用：Site(edge='s', position=1, face='binding')
== 5. loops left free by a seam ==
BLO/BLO seam, then the remaining front loops of both edges reserved and worked: ACCEPT :: created=28 consumed=20 final={'edge': 8}
free loop on the side the seam itself used: REJECT  [as expected] :: 该半针没有被先前的挑针操作保留，不能凭空补出
free loop of the side that was seamed through both loops: REJECT  [as expected] :: 该半针没有被先前的挑针操作保留，不能凭空补出
seam leaves front loops that are never mentioned again: ACCEPT :: created=12 consumed=12 final={}
   inventory: {'retired_without_work': 0, 'retirement_declarations': [], 'unconsumed_sites': 0} | created/consumed: 12 12
half-loop seam on a chain underside / reserved lip: REJECT  [as expected] :: 半针或特殊落针位不能再次拆分为半针
== 6. untracked plans: seam start is not tied to anything ==
untracked: seam begins at the far end of the last row: ACCEPT :: created=32 consumed=28 final={'outside': 4}
